        "content": "<p>Is there a consensus on how to indent these? What does the incoming autoformatter say?</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">long_term_1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_2</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_3</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">long_term_1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_2</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_3</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">long_term_1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_2</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_3</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">long_term_1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_2</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_3</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">long_term_1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_2</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_3</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">grind</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">long_term_1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_2</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_3</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
