        "content": "<p>Currently, it says</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span>\n<span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_2</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_3</span>\n<span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>eg <a href=\"https://github.com/Rob23oba/mathlib4/blob/b9f529a358f6a8222ef9dc4f9b009059a4fe2463/Mathlib/Condensed/TopCatAdjunction.lean#L72-L75\">here</a> or <a href=\"https://github.com/Rob23oba/mathlib4/blob/b9f529a358f6a8222ef9dc4f9b009059a4fe2463/Mathlib/Condensed/TopCatAdjunction.lean#L128-L131\">here</a></p>",
