        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"286014\">Robin Carlier</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/287929-mathlib4/topic/rw.20.2F.20simp.20.2F.20grind.20multiline.20style/near/628694912\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Currently, it says</p>\n<p><div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span>\n<span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_2</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">   </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_3</span>\n<span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div><br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I think you added a space too many:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">rw</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_2</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">long_term_3</span>\n<span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
